---
import SiteFrame from "../components/SiteFrame.astro";
import { documentation as documents } from "../project-data";
---
<SiteFrame title="Documentation — RepositoryZero" description="Source documents and implementation roadmaps for RepositoryZero."><section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">THE SOURCE OF THE PLAN</span><h1>Know what we're building.<br /><span>And what's still unproven.</span></h1><p>These Markdown documents are included from the repository at build time. Start with implementation status and accepted decisions. Specifications and historical experiments are labelled; EN/RU technical guides remain planned.</p></section><div class="document-grid">{documents.map((document) => <a class="document-card" href={"/docs/" + document.id + ".md"}><span class="tiny-label">MARKDOWN </span><h2>{document.title}</h2><p>{document.copy}</p></a>)}</div></SiteFrame>
